{"title": "Magic Resistance", "pageid": 6338, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Magic_Resistance", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Magical.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c6/Generic_Magical.webp/300px-Generic_Magical.webp, /w/images/c/c6/Generic_Magical.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c6/Generic_Magical.webp/300px-Generic_Magical.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c6/Generic_Magical.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Magic Resistance</b> is a passive feature that grants a creature advantage on saving throws against magical effects.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Has <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throws\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throws\">Saving Throws</a> against <a href=\"/wiki/Spells\" title=\"Spells\">Spells</a> and other magical effects. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Allandra_Grey\" title=\"Allandra Grey\">Allandra Grey</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Ansur\" title=\"Ansur\">Ansur</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Balthazar\" title=\"Balthazar\">Balthazar</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Blythe\" title=\"Blythe\">Blythe</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Cirian\" title=\"Cirian\">Cirian</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Dead_Mind_Flayer_(Goblin_Camp)\" title=\"Dead Mind Flayer (Goblin Camp)\">Dead Mind Flayer (Goblin Camp)</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Derysia\" title=\"Derysia\">Derysia</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Dominated_Red_Dragon\" title=\"Dominated Red Dragon\">Dominated Red Dragon</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Dream_Guardian\" title=\"Dream Guardian\">Dream Guardian</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Dryad\" title=\"Dryad\">Dryad</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Dryad_(Conjure_Woodland_Being)\" title=\"Dryad (Conjure Woodland Being)\">Dryad (Conjure Woodland Being)</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Elminster\" title=\"Elminster\">Elminster</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Eni\" title=\"Eni\">Eni</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Enver_Gortash\" title=\"Enver Gortash\">Enver Gortash</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Feona\" title=\"Feona\">Feona</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Flesh\" title=\"Flesh\">Flesh</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Fustian\" title=\"Fustian\">Fustian</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Ghislev\" title=\"Ghislev\">Ghislev</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Glyria\" title=\"Glyria\">Glyria</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Godey\" title=\"Godey\">Godey</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Hellfire_Watcher\" title=\"Hellfire Watcher\">Hellfire Watcher</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Hoarding_Merregon\" title=\"Hoarding Merregon\">Hoarding Merregon</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Illithid_Arcanist\" title=\"Illithid Arcanist\">Illithid Arcanist</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Kevo_Phogge\" title=\"Kevo Phogge\">Kevo Phogge</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/M%27alice\" title=\"M'alice\">M'alice</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Malus_Thorm\" title=\"Malus Thorm\">Malus Thorm</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Merregon_Legionnaire\" title=\"Merregon Legionnaire\">Merregon Legionnaire</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Mind_flayer_(nautiloid_wreck)\" title=\"Mind flayer (nautiloid wreck)\">Mind flayer (nautiloid wreck)</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Mind_flayer_(prologue)\" title=\"Mind flayer (prologue)\">Mind flayer (prologue)</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Mind_flayer_(windmill)\" title=\"Mind flayer (windmill)\">Mind flayer (windmill)</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Mind_flayers\" title=\"Mind flayers\">Mind flayers</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Mitchia\" title=\"Mitchia\">Mitchia</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Mizora\" title=\"Mizora\">Mizora</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Moonlight_Sliver\" title=\"Moonlight Sliver\">Moonlight Sliver</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Mystic_Carrion\" title=\"Mystic Carrion\">Mystic Carrion</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Nov_Shmoz\" title=\"Nov Shmoz\">Nov Shmoz</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Orin\" title=\"Orin\">Orin</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Qudenos\" title=\"Qudenos\">Qudenos</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Raphael\" title=\"Raphael\">Raphael</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Rycke\" title=\"Rycke\">Rycke</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Spaulder\" title=\"Spaulder\">Spaulder</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Spellplague\" title=\"Spellplague\">Spellplague</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Stalker_Svignee\" title=\"Stalker Svignee\">Stalker Svignee</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Steel_Watcher_(creature)\" title=\"Steel Watcher (creature)\">Steel Watcher (creature)</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Steel_Watcher_Titan\" title=\"Steel Watcher Titan\">Steel Watcher Titan</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/That_Which_Guards\" title=\"That Which Guards\">That Which Guards</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/That_Which_Lurks\" title=\"That Which Lurks\">That Which Lurks</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/That_Which_Watches\" title=\"That Which Watches\">That Which Watches</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/The_Emperor\" title=\"The Emperor\">